flowchart TD
  S([Business need]) --> A[SEC-01 Security Architect: classify data and risk]
  A --> G1{Risk acceptable?}
  G1 -- No --> STOP1([Reject scope / revise])
  G1 -- Yes --> B[SEC-02 Threat modeling: DFD / STRIDE]
  B --> C[Implementation]
  C --> D[SEC-03 DevSecOps: scan code / dependencies / SBOM]
  D --> G2{Critical findings?}
  G2 -- Yes --> C
  G2 -- No --> E[SEC-05 Independent Qualification: test + evidence]
  E --> G3{Qualified?}
  G3 -- No --> C
  G3 -- Yes --> H[Human release approval]
  H --> G4{Approved?}
  G4 -- No --> STOP2([Do not release])
  G4 -- Yes --> I[Deploy]
  I --> J[SEC-04 Runtime Policy: validate each action]
  J --> G5{Decision?}
  G5 -- DENY / BLOCK --> STOP3([Audit; no tool execution])
  G5 -- APPROVAL_REQUIRED --> K[Human action approval]
  K --> G6{Approved?}
  G6 -- No / Timeout --> STOP3
  G6 -- Yes --> L[Execute allowed tool]
  G5 -- ALLOW --> L
  L --> M[SEC-06 Security Monitoring]
  M --> G7{Incident / drift?}
  G7 -- Yes --> N[Revoke trust; contain; requalify]
  N --> E
  G7 -- No --> J
